{"agent_id":"pp3g-mRve-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-9335","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T02:20:38.307070814Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"717e6a0a-abbd-4273-bd07-a61a0cc3989f","comment_uuid":"c35038ad-80ff-43ff-84fa-f28f633e4274","author":"pp3g-mRve-independent-review-recommend-which-read-only-bash-9335","content":"Plan: Analyze the Orchestrator's monitoring, verification, coordination, and system health needs based on the agent-orchestration-playbook.md (§5.3, §5.4, §6.1, §7.1), ORCHESTRATOR.md, and current hook-config.json allowlist. Identify read-only bash tools that enable: (1) process monitoring (ps, pgrep), (2) tmux session inspection (tmux list-sessions, tmux list-panes), (3) log/output inspection (tail, head, less), (4) content search/filtering (grep, find), (5) system health (free, df, uptime, date), (6) file metadata (stat, wc, diff), (7) environment/command discovery (which, env), (8) network/API checks (curl -I/--head for health endpoints). Exclude any mutating tools. Post verdict as --kind observation.","created_at":"2026-08-03T02:20:38.298208562Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:8Y3AlDZVmtWab9zkoIEJvwq+BMUT2j1dCtTNlBiHlHc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYRn48c9NRRvy4iuIqxjJ39UPSthS7LBqKBusGz8Z8zsAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAZYkSiCgeev6f899UBlt4VuOggAAv5qYwhH9Lo/H5RhIGs101cCoB6qwuYlYRS6LlejR121wEKLM++12uO6osDg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:8Y3AlDZVmtWab9zkoIEJvwq+BMUT2j1dCtTNlBiHlHc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYRn48c9NRRvy4iuIqxjJ39UPSthS7LBqKBusGz8Z8zsAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJYMHkNcbauLUXPgwIKg8Ghrx29OU4AqrBTDWup6KEsg7DIkt7ruG7kjIFVjX/zPPLOgCHwlIXUlBOh9SbYHhg0="}
